https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112403#issuecomment-3489759027","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112403","id":3489759027,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QAX8z","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T07:38:23Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T07:38:23Z","body":"Yes, this is expected (though not obvious) behavior. The engine implicitly expects resources (textures, styleboxes) used in `draw_*()` calls to exist at least until the draw commands in `RenderingServer` that use these resources are cleared.\n\nLocal variables are destroyed upon exiting the block/function, and if there are no other references to the texture/stylebox, they are cleared from memory. `RenderingServer`, being a low-level API, does not increment the resource's reference count (it operates on `RID`s instead).\n\nThis point probably needs to be documented.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3489759027/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]